  "subtitle": "Flaky cod poached in a rich Spanish-style sauce",
  "excerpt": "Cod fillets poached directly in a smoky tomato sauce with peppers, olives, and capers. The fish stays moist and absorbs the sauce as it cooks. A one-pan dinner that needs nothing more than bread to mop up the sauce.",
